# LibreOffice / Excel lock and temp files. A stale .~lock file left behind by a
# timed-out LibreOffice run will block every later attempt to open that workbook.
.~lock.*#
~$*

# Regenerated intermediate data.
# The three Part A cleaned tables total 47 MB and are rebuilt byte-identically by run_all.sh in
# about 90 seconds from the raw files, which ARE committed. Committing them would triple the
# repository for no benefit. The small cleaned outputs (both cleaning logs and the Part B customer
# table) stay in the repo because they are the audit trail and are tiny.
data/cleaned/partA_customers.csv
data/cleaned/partA_orders.csv
data/cleaned/partA_order_items.csv
